{"version":1,"content":"<p>國際信用評級機構穆迪評級公司將美國晶片製造商英偉達的信用評級展望從「正面」下調至「穩定」。該機構給出的理由是，在長期擔任行政總裁的黃仁勳離任後，英偉達出現治理層面的擔憂。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587164.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T05:43:58.619407+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:24:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:37:14.454721+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T05:37:14.454721+00:00","content_hash":"7417f3e5499b20f184e8bf6ad45f30e0148020624b0fe438c29e6691a115b5fb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}